<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">

<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Code de réinitialisation</title>
  <style type="text/css">
    body {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%;
      -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%;
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;
      background-color: #e5e7eb;
    }

    table {
      border-collapse: collapse;
      mso-table-lspace: 0;
      mso-table-rspace: 0;
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>
  <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0" style="background-color:#e5e7eb;">
    <tr>
      <td align="center" style="padding:40px 20px;">
        <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0"
          style="max-width:600px;margin:0 auto;background-color:#ffffff;border-radius:8px;box-shadow:0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.07);">
          <tr>
            <td align="center" style="padding:24px 24px 16px;">
              <span style="font-size:14px;font-style:italic;color:#111827;">Restaurant</span>
              <span style="font-size:28px;font-weight:700;color:#111827;letter-spacing:-0.5px;"> OS</span>
            </td>
          </tr>

          <tr>
            <td align="center" style="padding:8px 48px 0;">
              <h1 style="margin:0;font-size:22px;font-weight:700;color:#111827;">Code de vérification</h1>
            </td>
          </tr>

          <tr>
            <td align="center" style="padding:12px 48px 16px;">
              <p style="margin:0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;color:#6b7280;">
                Bonjour{{#if name}} {{name}}{{/if}}, voici ton code pour réinitialiser ton mot de passe.
              </p>
            </td>
          </tr>

          <tr>
            <td align="center" style="padding:0 48px 8px;">
              <div
                style="display:inline-block;background:#111827;color:#ffffff;font-size:28px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:10px;padding:14px 18px;border-radius:8px;">
                {{otp}}
              </div>
            </td>
          </tr>

          <tr>
            <td align="center" style="padding:8px 48px 24px;">
              <p style="margin:0;font-size:13px;line-height:1.6;color:#6b7280;">
                Ce code expire dans {{minutes}} minutes. Si tu n'es pas à l'origine de cette demande, ignore cet email.
              </p>
            </td>
          </tr>

          <tr>
            <td style="padding:24px 48px;background-color:#f9fafb;border-radius:0 0 8px 8px;">
              <p style="margin:0;font-size:12px;line-height:1.5;color:#9ca3af;text-align:center;">
                Restaurant OS — Email automatique
              </p>
            </td>
          </tr>
        </table>
      </td>
    </tr>
  </table>
</body>

</html>

